os-power-title = Power & Battery
os-power-subtitle = Battery, charging and power behavior
os-power-status = Power status
os-power-readonly = Shows battery and AC status when host telemetry is available. Low-battery notifications fire at 20%, 10%, and 5%. Lid policy and configurable critical actions require backend support and remain read-only in this build.
os-display-title = Display
os-display-subtitle = Brightness, scaling and external displays
os-display-status = Display status
os-display-readonly = Display controls are read-only until the OS display backend is connected.
os-sound-title = Sound
os-sound-subtitle = Output, input and volume
os-sound-status = Sound status
os-sound-readonly = Audio device control is unavailable without the OS audio backend.
os-keyboard-title = Keyboard & Region
os-keyboard-subtitle = Input language, layout and regional formats
os-keyboard-status = Input & region status
os-keyboard-readonly = Keyboard layout and region settings are read-only here until the OS input backend is available.
os-storage-reset-title = Storage & Reset
os-storage-reset-subtitle = Disk usage, cleanup and device reset options
os-storage-reset-status = Storage status
os-storage-reset-readonly = Reset actions are disabled because the OS management backend is not connected. No destructive action is performed from this page.
os-users-title = Users
os-users-subtitle = Local device accounts and access
os-users-status = Local users
os-users-readonly = Local user management requires the OS accounts backend. Account data is not modified from this page.
os-diagnostics-title = Diagnostics
os-diagnostics-subtitle = Health checks, logs and support information
os-diagnostics-status = Diagnostics status
os-diagnostics-readonly = Diagnostic collection is read-only and depends on the OS diagnostics backend.
os-backend-pending = Waiting for OS backend…
os-backend-unavailable = OS backend endpoint unavailable in this build. This page is read-only.
os-backend-connected = Connected to OS backend.

